<title>USA: UltraFem files for 3.0 mln common shares.</title>
<headline>UltraFem files for 3.0 mln common shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>UltraFem Inc filed Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to 3.0 million common shares.</p>
<p>The company said net proceeds will be used for expenses related to the launching of its product.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Jefferies and Co Inc and Hampshire Seucriites Corp. The underwriters have an over-allotment option for up to 450,000 additional shares.</p>
</text>
